<title>USA: EnergyNorth unit in Vermont propane venture.</title>
<headline>EnergyNorth unit in Vermont propane venture.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, N.H. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>EnergyNorth Propane Inc, a subsidiary of EnergyNorth Inc and Northern New England Gas Corp, said Monday it agreed to start a retail propane gas company in Vermont.</p>
<p>The new venture will serve customers in northwest Vermont under the name VGS Propane LLC.</p>
<p>EnergyNorth Propane, a public utility holding company, serves about 12,000 customers in southern and central New Hampshire.</p>
